      "title": "Capri Global Capital Limited Announces Resignation of Monu Ratra as Chief Executive Officer, Effective January 19, 2026",
      "body": "Capri Global Capital Limited announced that Mr. Monu Ratra, who was appointed as the Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of the company designated as a Key Managerial Personnel (KMP) and forming part of the Senior Management, with effect from October 7, 2025, has tendered his resignation from the said position. His resignation as CEO (KMP) is effective from January 19, 2026 and his last working day will be at the close of business hours on January 31, 2026. Mr. Ratra has resigned to pursue an entrepreneurial path, driven by his long-term personal aspirations. This decision is purely driven by long-term personal aspiration to build and engage in entrepreneurial ventures and is not on account of any disagreement, concern, or difference of opinion with the Board, management, or the affairs of the c",
